*.zip

# --- build output -----------------------------------------------------------
# Everything here is regenerated by `npm run build`. None of it is source:
#   dist/extension/{chrome,firefox}  staged copies of the repo root
#   app/.build/                       concatenated bundles + inlined assets
#   app/android/app/src/main/assets/waincognito/  staged copies for GeckoView
#   release/                          electron-builder installers
dist/
release/
app/.build/
app/android/.gradle/
app/android/build/
app/android/app/build/
app/android/app/src/main/assets/waincognito/
.gradle/

